  "body": "Bumps the dev-dependencies group with 3 updates in the / directory: [@types/node](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/node), [@types/react](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/react) and [netlify-cli](https://github.com/netlify/cli).\n\nUpdates `@types/node` from 25.9.1 to 25.9.2\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/node\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `@types/react` from 19.2.16 to 19.2.17\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/react\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `netlify-cli` from 26.0.2 to 26.1.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/releases\">netlify-cli's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v26.1.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/compare/v26.0.2...v26.1.0\">26.1.0</a> (2026-05-31)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add support for new function config properties (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8278\">#8278</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/826fde792986d3829d223b4c08fbb6f0b8a61e19\">826fde7</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> remove <code>uuid</code> dependency (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8275\">#8275</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/4f2a96bc962aa9aaf82d7d57435c790156d379f1\">4f2a96b</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> replace <code>extract-zip</code> and update Netlify packages (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8277\">#8277</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/c078a98c5a8ea6dd14ecdbb159ae5c225761815e\">c078a98</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update dependency <code>@​netlify/blobs</code> to ^10.7.7 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8252\">#8252</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/dfcc0a221d406ec897799ffa3b42d8989de30b0d\">dfcc0a2</a>)</li>\n<li>infinite loop on error (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8269\">#8269</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/a3549b88bf4b1754811468bbf378fcd461f57a45\">a3549b8</a>)</li>\n<li>user sending the wrong command is not an error (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8270\">#8270</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/21fe0389ed608e30ea9a50fd737bef026056617c\">21fe038</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">netlify-cli's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/compare/v26.0.2...v26.1.0\">26.1.0</a> (2026-05-31)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add support for new function config properties (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8278\">#8278</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/826fde792986d3829d223b4c08fbb6f0b8a61e19\">826fde7</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> remove <code>uuid</code> dependency (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8275\">#8275</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/4f2a96bc962aa9aaf82d7d57435c790156d379f1\">4f2a96b</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> replace <code>extract-zip</code> and update Netlify packages (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8277\">#8277</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/c078a98c5a8ea6dd14ecdbb159ae5c225761815e\">c078a98</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update dependency <code>@​netlify/blobs</code> to ^10.7.7 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8252\">#8252</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/dfcc0a221d406ec897799ffa3b42d8989de30b0d\">dfcc0a2</a>)</li>\n<li>infinite loop on error (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8269\">#8269</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/a3549b88bf4b1754811468bbf378fcd461f57a45\">a3549b8</a>)</li>\n<li>user sending the wrong command is not an error (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8270\">#8270</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/21fe0389ed608e30ea9a50fd737bef026056617c\">21fe038</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/c9d17728137ebafa25c4aa36f9704a1f25a4b44f\"><code>c9d1772</code></a> chore(main): release 26.1.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8260\">#8260</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/df286f4a598da0503ba08bddc02382a0802a4dc7\"><code>df286f4</code></a> chore(ci): pin Node.js 24 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8279\">#8279</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/968562de554137939591c6d411d71790b71e3e8b\"><code>968562d</code></a> chore: stabilize integration test suite (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8209\">#8209</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/4f2a96bc962aa9aaf82d7d57435c790156d379f1\"><code>4f2a96b</code></a> fix(deps): remove <code>uuid</code> dependency (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8275\">#8275</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/826fde792986d3829d223b4c08fbb6f0b8a61e19\"><code>826fde7</code></a> feat: add support for new function config properties (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8278\">#8278</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/c078a98c5a8ea6dd14ecdbb159ae5c225761815e\"><code>c078a98</code></a> fix(deps): replace <code>extract-zip</code> and update Netlify packages (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8277\">#8277</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/8a07280b83de35aae6dee80212d4e065147e3456\"><code>8a07280</code></a> docs: fix typo &quot;agains&quot; → &quot;against&quot; in netlify-function.ts JSDoc (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8243\">#8243</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/21fe0389ed608e30ea9a50fd737bef026056617c\"><code>21fe038</code></a> fix: user sending the wrong command is not an error (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8270\">#8270</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/a3549b88bf4b1754811468bbf378fcd461f57a45\"><code>a3549b8</code></a> fix: infinite loop on error (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8269\">#8269</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/commit/113432117a27bfad67e7578e39b40613e2ba16c8\"><code>1134321</code></a> chore(deps): update dependency ws to v8.20.1 [security] (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/netlify/cli/issues/8267\">#8267</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/netlify/cli/compare/v26.0.2...v26.1.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
